#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#Generic E-Class Sedan (Full-Size) with SLA front suspension, 5-Link rear suspension, and an externally defined powertrain.
#
#E-Class vehicles include the Audi A6, BMW 5-Series, Cadillac XTS, Chrysler 300C, Lexus GS, and Mercedes-Benz E-Class.
#
#This example vehicle's entire 4WD powertrain is externally defined. The control signals come from user-supplied programming such as Simulink or C-Code. Users can then tune the software control and see how the vehicle reacts. Click on the Powertrain blue link for more information regarding the settings for the externally defined powertrain.
#
#Updated for CarSim 2017: Revised the steering system parameters.  Tested for: On Center, Static Steer (Brakes ON / Brakes OFF), Transient Response, Torque Free Response, Turning Circle, and others.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

